<title>USA: PepsiCo Inc Q1 net income $0.27.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo Inc Q1 net income $0.27.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 Weeks Ended	   %</p>
<p>						 3/22/97  3/23/96  Change</p>
<p> Net Sales				   6,702	6,554	 2</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses, net</p>
